title 03 - Tanaris & Feralas (44-45)
faction Horde
levels 44-45
zone map 1446
coords live
category Leveling
folder Five Friends 43-48
keywords group, horde, dungeon, five friends
version 3
Five-player quest route. Level band 44-45 is an estimate, not a grind requirement.
next five-friends-43-48/03-shendralas

step Gadgetzan pickups
  tip Save Zul'Farrak itself for the later chapter; its remote prerequisites are still being prepared.
  accept 1690 "Wastewander Justice" lvl 40 @52.5,28.5 -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle.
  accept 2781 "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting" lvl 39 -- Wanted poster in Gadgetzan.
  accept 97534 "Gritty Business" lvl 40 @51.1,27.9 -- Quinn.
  accept 992 "Gadgetzan Water Survey" lvl 38 @50.2,27.5 -- Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser.

step First Wastewander pass
  complete 1690 "Wastewander Justice" -- Kill 10 Wastewander Bandits and 10 Thieves.
  complete 97534 "Gritty Business" -- Pick up seven Desert Debris ground objects per player.
  complete 992 "Gadgetzan Water Survey" -- Use the supplied testing gadget at the quest's fixed water pool.

step Gadgetzan follow-up
  turnin 1690 "Wastewander Justice" xp 3600 @52.5,28.5 -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle.
  accept 1691 "More Wastewander Justice" lvl 40 @52.5,28.5
  turnin 97534 "Gritty Business" xp 2900 @51.1,27.9 -- Quinn.
  turnin 992 "Gadgetzan Water Survey" xp 3050 @50.2,27.5 -- Fizzledowser.

step Second Wastewander pass
  complete 1691 "More Wastewander Justice" -- Kill 10 Shadow Mages, 8 Rogues and 6 Assassins.
  complete 2781 "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting" group 5 -- Kill Caliph Scorpidsting and loot his head; every player checks credit.

step Wastewander rewards
  turnin 1691 "More Wastewander Justice" xp 3750 @52.5,28.5 -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle.
  turnin 2781 "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting" xp 5050 @52.5,28.5 -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle.

step Steamwheedle setup
  turnin 2872 "Stoley's Debt" xp 390 @67.1,24.0 -- Stoley.
  accept 2873 "Stoley's Shipment" lvl 40 @67.1,24.0 -- Stoley.
  accept 8366 "Southsea Shakedown" lvl 40 @67.1,23.9 -- Security Chief Bilgewhizzle.
  accept 2875 "WANTED: Andre Firebeard" lvl 40 @66.8,22.3 -- Wanted poster.
  accept 3520 "Screecher Spirits" lvl 40 @67.0,22.4 -- Yeh'kinya; take his bramble to Feralas.

step Lost Rigger Cove
  tip Ship Schedules is only a bonus if the starter naturally drops; it is not required or budgeted. No farming it for the group.
  complete 8366 "Southsea Shakedown" -- Kill 10 Pirates, 10 Freebooters, 10 Dock Workers and 10 Swashbucklers.
  complete 2873 "Stoley's Shipment" -- Loot Stoley's shipment from its ground crate in the building.
  complete 2875 "WANTED: Andre Firebeard" group 5 -- Kill Andre Firebeard and collect the head.

step Steamwheedle rewards
  turnin 8366 "Southsea Shakedown" xp 3900 @67.1,23.9 -- Security Chief Bilgewhizzle.
  turnin 2873 "Stoley's Shipment" xp 3900 @67.1,24.0 -- Stoley.
  accept 2874 "Deliver to MacKinley" lvl 40 @67.1,24.0 -- Keep the delivery for Booty Bay.
  turnin 2875 "WANTED: Andre Firebeard" xp 3900 @67.1,23.9 -- Security Chief Bilgewhizzle.

step Camp Mojache introduction
  zone map 1444
  turnin 2981 "A Threat in Feralas" xp 890 @75.8,43.6 -- Rok Orhan.
  accept 2975 "The Ogres of Feralas" lvl 38 @75.8,43.6 -- Rok Orhan.
  accept 2987 "Gordunni Cobalt" lvl 38 @75.7,44.3 -- Orwin Gizzmick; keep the shovel.
  accept 92878 "Lost for Words" lvl 36 @74.9,44.0 -- Blaise Montgomery.
  accept 2862 "War on the Woodpaw" lvl 39 @74.9,42.5 -- Hadoken Swiftstrider.

step Gordunni Outpost
  complete 2975 "The Ogres of Feralas" -- Kill 10 Gordunni Ogres, 10 Ogre-Magi and 5 Brutes.
  complete 2987 "Gordunni Cobalt" -- Use the supplied shovel on cobalt ground mounds; 12 cobalt per player.
  accept 2978 "The Gordunni Scroll" lvl 38 @80.5,34.3 -- Loot the ground scroll near the training dummies, then right-click it in your bags to accept.

step Northern named target
  complete 92878 "Lost for Words" group 5 -- Kill Namida Grimtotem around 68,39 and collect Namida's Hoof.
  note "OPTIONAL OBJECT CHECK: /mappin 1444 69.6 43.3. While near the Grimtotem camp, check the Grimtotem Chest by the diseased shaman remains for a Grimtotem Necklace. Keep it for the Broken Woodpaw Staff. The location is in current Forever data; if the container is absent or unusable, continue." @69.6,43.3 map 1444

step Camp Mojache northern rewards
  tip Do not extend the scroll into the unverified-drop Dark Ceremony/Orb branch for this route.
  turnin 2975 "The Ogres of Feralas" xp 2700 @75.8,43.6 -- Rok Orhan.
  accept 2980 "The Ogres of Feralas" lvl 38 @75.8,43.6 -- Rok Orhan.
  turnin 2987 "Gordunni Cobalt" xp 3600 @75.7,44.3 -- Orwin Gizzmick.
  turnin 2978 "The Gordunni Scroll" xp 1800 @75.8,43.6 -- Rok Orhan.
  turnin 92878 "Lost for Words" xp 4450 @74.9,44.0 -- Blaise Montgomery.

step The Old Key starter
  accept 95599 "The Old Key" lvl 35 @76.6,48.0 -- Open the Old Crate beside the tent, then click the key in your bags to accept.
  note "EXISTING ROUTE OBJECT: /mappin 1444 76.6 48.0. Open the Old Crate beside the tent; each player uses their own Old Key to accept. This is the same scheduled quest, not another pickup." @76.6,48.0 map 1444

step The Old Key chest
  turnin 95599 "The Old Key" xp 3450 @79.2,49.4 -- Open the submerged Old Chest; be ready for the elemental ambush.
  note "EXISTING ROUTE OBJECT: /mappin 1444 79.2 49.4. The Old Chest is underwater. Current reports describe three elementals attacking after the hand-in; keep the party together." @79.2,49.4 map 1444

step Woodpaw introduction collection
  tip This collection is retained because it unlocks Alpha Strike, the battle-map chain, and Stinglasher. It is an explicit chain exception, not a claim of 80% drops.
  complete 2862 "War on the Woodpaw" -- Gather 10 Woodpaw Gnoll Manes per player around the Woodpaw camps.
  note "OPTIONAL OBJECT CHECK: /mappin 1444 66.4 50.9. If your Woodpaw circuit passes the dead diseased mystic, inspect the Woodpaw Bag for a Broken Woodpaw Staff. With a Grimtotem Necklace, combine the pieces out of combat into a Diseased Nature Staff and use it to start Corrupted Nature. The bag has a current map record; live loot and availability remain unverified. Skip if unavailable." @66.4,50.9 map 1444

step Start the timed Alpha Strike
  tip Alpha Strike has a one-hour timer. Do its five kills immediately before any other detour.
  turnin 2862 "War on the Woodpaw" xp 2550 @74.9,42.5 -- Hadoken Swiftstrider.
  accept 2863 "Alpha Strike" lvl 39 @74.9,42.5 -- Accept only when all five are ready.

step Alpha Strike kills
  complete 2863 "Alpha Strike" -- Kill five Woodpaw Alphas now.

step Alpha Strike hand-in
  turnin 2863 "Alpha Strike" xp 2700 @74.9,42.5 -- Hadoken.
  accept 2902 "Woodpaw Investigation" lvl 39 @74.9,42.5 -- Hadoken.

step Woodpaw battle map
  turnin 2902 "Woodpaw Investigation" xp 1800 @71.6,55.9 -- The Woodpaw Battle Map.
  accept 2903 "The Battle Plans" lvl 39 @71.6,55.9 -- Accept the delivery from the map.

step Battle Plans and insect pickups
  turnin 2903 "The Battle Plans" xp 3600 @74.9,42.5 -- Hadoken.
  accept 7730 "Zukk'ash Infestation" lvl 39 @74.9,42.5 -- Hadoken.
  accept 7731 "Stinglasher" lvl 39 @74.9,42.5 -- Hadoken.

step Southern ogres and the Writhing Deep
  tip Both insect quests are needed for Zukk'ash Report. Finish the carapaces while clearing to the named target; this is the second Feralas chain exception.
  complete 2980 "The Ogres of Feralas" -- Kill 10 Gordunni Shamans, 10 Warlocks and 5 Maulers.
  complete 7730 "Zukk'ash Infestation" -- Collect 20 Zukk'ash Carapaces per player.
  complete 7731 "Stinglasher" group 5 -- Kill Stinglasher and loot the glands.

step Southern Feralas rewards
  turnin 2980 "The Ogres of Feralas" xp 3750 @75.8,43.6 -- Rok Orhan.
  turnin 7730 "Zukk'ash Infestation" xp 3900 @74.9,42.5 -- Hadoken.
  turnin 7731 "Stinglasher" xp 4200 @74.9,42.5 -- Hadoken.
  accept 7732 "Zukk'ash Report" lvl 39 @74.9,42.5 -- Hold the report for Orgrimmar.
  note "OPTIONAL BAG CHECK: If you found both Corrupted Nature components, combine the Grimtotem Necklace and Broken Woodpaw Staff out of combat, then use the Diseased Nature Staff. Follow any available in-game quest marker if you choose the extra event; its complete live sequence is not verified or required by this route."

step Screecher Spirits before leaving Feralas
  tip Do this before leaving for Desolace. Keep the completed quest until the pre-Zul'Farrak Steamwheedle visit. Continue through Desolace's Valley of Bones into Shen'dralas.
  complete 3520 "Screecher Spirits" -- Kill three Vale Screechers on the western coast, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on their corpses, and speak to the spirits.
